msgstr "正确性 / 不变量"

#: manual/design/adapter.md:126
msgid "The contract test `src/adapter/poly_adapter_wbtest.mbt` checks a lawful adapter for a four-kind AST:"
msgstr "契约测试 `src/adapter/poly_adapter_wbtest.mbt` 针对一个有四种节点的 AST 检查一个合法的 adapter："

#: manual/design/adapter.md:129
msgid "Property"
msgstr "性质"

#: manual/design/adapter.md:129
msgid "Check"
msgstr "检查"

#: manual/design/adapter.md:131
msgid "simultaneous one-pass substitution"
msgstr "同时的单遍代换"

#: manual/design/adapter.md:131
msgid "$\\{x \\mapsto y, y \\mapsto 2\\}$ on $x + y$ gives $y + 2$"
msgstr "$\\{x \\mapsto y, y \\mapsto 2\\}$ 作用于 $x + y$ 得到 $y + 2$"

#: manual/design/adapter.md:132
msgid "unmapped variables are kept"
msgstr "未映射的变量保持不变"

#: manual/design/adapter.md:132
msgid "$\\{x \\mapsto 3\\}$ on $x + y$ gives $3 + y$"
msgstr "$\\{x \\mapsto 3\\}$ 作用于 $x + y$ 得到 $3 + y$"

#: manual/design/adapter.md:133
msgid "rewriting rebuilds through constructors"
msgstr "重写通过构造子重建"

#: manual/design/adapter.md:133
msgid "$1 + (0 + 2) \\to 1 + 2$ at path `[ApplyArgument(0)]`"
msgstr "在路径 `[ApplyArgument(0)]` 处 $1 + (0 + 2) \\to 1 + 2$"

#: manual/design/adapter.md:135
msgid "Downstream adapters should add tests of (V1)–(V5) for their own node kinds: project each constructor's result, rebuild each projected node, and check that opaque nodes have no free variables."
msgstr "下游 adapter 应为自己的节点种类添加 (V1)–(V5) 的测试：投影每个构造子的结果，重建每个被投影的节点，并检查 opaque 节点没有自由变量。"

#: manual/design/adapter.md:139
#: manual/design/core.md:166
#: manual/design/debruijn.md:220
#: manual/design/eval.md:135
#: manual/design/rewrite.md:184
#: manual/design/stlc.md:302
#: manual/design/substitution.md:229
#: manual/design/syntax.md:237
#: manual/design/utlc/lambda.md:124
#: manual/design/utlc/nbe.md:182
msgid "Alternatives rejected"
msgstr "被否决的替代方案"

#: manual/design/adapter.md:141
msgid "**Making `Term[T]` the only AST.** Rejected because downstream ASTs carry invariants (normalized coefficients, typed nodes) that `Term[T]` cannot express."
msgstr "**让 `Term[T]` 成为唯一的 AST。** 被否决，因为下游 AST 携带 `Term[T]` 无法表达的不变量（范式化的系数、带类型的节点）。"

#: manual/design/adapter.md:144
msgid "**A larger view with sorts or multi-binders.** More cases would make every adapter and every generic algorithm larger; nested `Bind` nodes express multi-binders."
msgstr "**带有 sort 或多元绑定子的更大视图。** 更多分支会使每个 adapter 和每个泛型算法都变得更大；嵌套的 `Bind` 节点就能表达多元绑定子。"

#: manual/design/adapter.md:147
msgid "**Checking the laws at run time.** The laws are equations over all nodes; they are tested, not enforced."
msgstr "**在运行时检查定律。** 这些定律是关于所有节点的等式；它们通过测试验证，而非强制执行。"

#: manual/design/adapter.md:150
#: manual/design/core.md:179
#: manual/design/debruijn.md:232
#: manual/design/eval.md:149
#: manual/design/rewrite.md:196
#: manual/design/stlc.md:315
#: manual/design/substitution.md:243
#: manual/design/syntax.md:251
