#: manual/semantics.md:1
msgid "Semantic architecture"
msgstr "语义架构"

#: manual/semantics.md:3
msgid "This guide explains how the packages of `type_theory` fit together: which package defines what, how the three normalizers of the lambda calculus relate, and how failures are reported. The individual design pages give the definitions and proofs."
msgstr "本指南说明 `type_theory` 的各个包如何组合在一起：哪个包定义什么、λ 演算的三个范式化器之间的关系，以及失败如何报告。各设计页面给出定义与证明。"

#: manual/semantics.md:8
msgid "Layers"
msgstr "层次"

#: manual/semantics.md:10
msgid "The library is built in layers, each defined in terms of the ones below it."
msgstr "本库分层构建，每一层都以其下方的层来定义。"

#: manual/semantics.md:12
msgid "**Names** ([core](design/core.md)). A name is a string compared by equality; freshness is always relative to an explicit set of used names, so every result is deterministic."
msgstr "**名字**（[core](design/core.md)）。名字是按相等性比较的字符串；新鲜性总是相对于一个显式的已用名字集合，因此每个结果都是确定的。"

#: manual/semantics.md:15
msgid "**Binding syntax** ([syntax](design/syntax.md)). `Term[T]` is named syntax with opaque constants, n-ary application and one-variable binders. Free variables, alpha-equivalence and capture-avoiding renaming are defined here. The trait `BindingSyntax` exposes the same structure for any downstream AST through a one-layer view."
msgstr "**绑定语法**（[syntax](design/syntax.md)）。`Term[T]` 是带不透明常量、n 元应用和单变量绑定子的具名语法。自由变量、α-等价和避免捕获的重命名在此定义。trait `BindingSyntax` 通过单层视图为任意下游 AST 暴露相同的结构。"

#: manual/semantics.md:20
msgid "**Substitution** ([substitution](design/substitution.md)). Simultaneous, one-pass, capture-avoiding substitution, with composition and the substitution lemma, for `Term[T]` and for every `BindingSyntax` AST."
msgstr "**代换**（[substitution](design/substitution.md)）。同时、一趟、避免捕获的代换，带有复合与代换引理，适用于 `Term[T]` 及每个 `BindingSyntax` AST。"

#: manual/semantics.md:23
msgid "**Rewriting** ([rewrite](design/rewrite.md), [eval](design/eval.md)). A rule rewrites a term at its root; a traversal applies it at one position and reports the rule and the path; normalizers and traces repeat single steps within a step limit. `eval` names the standard strategies."
msgstr "**重写**（[rewrite](design/rewrite.md)、[eval](design/eval.md)）。规则在项的根处重写它；遍历在某一个位置应用规则并报告规则与路径；范式化器与轨迹在步数上限内重复单步。`eval` 为标准策略命名。"

#: manual/semantics.md:27
msgid "**Calculi** ([utlc/lambda](design/utlc/lambda.md), [debruijn](design/debruijn.md), [utlc/nbe](design/utlc/nbe.md), [stlc](design/stlc.md)). The untyped lambda calculus in named and nameless form, untyped normalization by evaluation, and the simply typed lambda calculus."
msgstr "**演算**（[utlc/lambda](design/utlc/lambda.md)、[debruijn](design/debruijn.md)、[utlc/nbe](design/utlc/nbe.md)、[stlc](design/stlc.md)）。具名与无名形式的无类型 λ 演算、无类型的基于求值的范式化，以及简单类型 λ 演算。"

#: manual/semantics.md:33
msgid "Downstream ASTs enter at layer 2 by implementing `BindingSyntax` (see the [adapter design](design/adapter.md)) and then use layers 3 and 4 directly. Domain rules, canonical forms and fixed-point policies stay in the downstream package; the substrate fixes none of them."
msgstr "下游 AST 通过实现 `BindingSyntax` 进入第 2 层（见 [adapter 设计](design/adapter.md)），然后直接使用第 3 层和第 4 层。领域规则、规范形式和不动点策略都留在下游包中；基底不固定其中任何一项。"

#: manual/semantics.md:38
msgid "One semantics, three normalizers"
msgstr "一种语义，三个范式化器"

#: manual/semantics.md:40
msgid "The untyped lambda calculus has one reference semantics: normal-order beta(-eta) reduction on named terms, a sequence of single steps produced by the rewrite layer. Two faster implementations are checked against it."
msgstr "无类型 λ 演算只有一个参考语义：具名项上的正规序 β(-η) 归约，即由重写层产生的单步序列。另外两个更快的实现以它为基准进行检验。"

#: manual/semantics.md:44
msgid "Normalizer"
msgstr "范式化器"

#: manual/semantics.md:44
msgid "Representation"
msgstr "表示"

#: manual/semantics.md:44
msgid "Bound"
msgstr "界限"

#: manual/semantics.md:44
msgid "Output"
msgstr "输出"

#: manual/semantics.md:46
msgid "named `Term[T]`"
msgstr "具名 `Term[T]`"

#: manual/semantics.md:46
msgid "normal order, beta and eta"
msgstr "正规序，β 与 η"

#: manual/semantics.md:46
#: manual/semantics.md:47
msgid "step limit"
msgstr "步数上限"

#: manual/semantics.md:46
msgid "beta-eta normal, n-ary spines kept"
msgstr "β-η 范式，保留 n 元脊"

#: manual/semantics.md:47
msgid "normal order, beta"
msgstr "正规序，β"

#: manual/semantics.md:47
msgid "beta normal, n-ary spines kept"
msgstr "β 范式，保留 n 元脊"

#: manual/semantics.md:48
msgid "evaluation + readback, call by name"
msgstr "求值 + 读回，传名调用"

#: manual/semantics.md:48
msgid "fuel"
msgstr "燃料"

#: manual/semantics.md:48
msgid "beta normal, unary applications"
msgstr "β 范式，一元应用"

#: manual/semantics.md:50
msgid "They agree in the following sense. Conversion to De Bruijn form commutes with beta steps up to alpha-equivalence ([debruijn design](design/debruijn.md)), so the named and nameless reducers take corresponding steps. NbE is sound for beta and realizes the same normalizing strategy ([utlc/nbe design](design/utlc/nbe.md)). Because beta reduction is confluent, whenever two of them return a beta normal form for the same term, the results coincide after conversion and after flattening application spines. Eta is only part of the named reducer."
msgstr "它们在如下意义上一致。转换为 De Bruijn 形式与 β 步在 α-等价意义下交换（[debruijn 设计](design/debruijn.md)），因此具名与无名归约器执行对应的步骤。NbE 对 β 是可靠的，并实现了相同的范式化策略（[utlc/nbe 设计](design/utlc/nbe.md)）。由于 β 归约是合流的，只要其中两者对同一个项都返回 β 范式，结果在转换并展平应用脊之后就是一致的。η 只属于具名归约器。"

#: manual/semantics.md:59
msgid "For typed terms, [stlc](design/stlc.md) adds a fourth normalizer: type-directed NbE, which needs no bound and returns beta-normal, eta-long forms, and therefore decides beta-eta equality of well-typed terms (eta for function types)."
msgstr "对于有类型项，[stlc](design/stlc.md) 增加了第四个范式化器：类型导向的 NbE，它不需要界限，返回 β-范式、η-长形式的结果，因此能判定良类型项的 β-η 相等性（η 针对函数类型）。"

#: manual/semantics.md:64
msgid "Failure reporting"
msgstr "失败报告"

#: manual/semantics.md:66
msgid "Expected failures at public boundaries are values, never aborts:"
msgstr "公开边界上的预期失败都是值，从不中止："

#: manual/semantics.md:68
msgid "invalid input data is reported in `Result` types, for example `RuleName::new(\"\")` returns `Err(RuleNameError::Empty)`, and type errors are `TypeError` values;"
msgstr "无效的输入数据以 `Result` 类型报告，例如 `RuleName::new(\"\")` 返回 `Err(RuleNameError::Empty)`，类型错误则是 `TypeError` 值；"

#: manual/semantics.md:71
msgid "index errors in De Bruijn terms are `ScopeError` values, carried by `DbStepResult`, `DbNormalizationResult` and the NbE results;"
msgstr "De Bruijn 项中的索引错误是 `ScopeError` 值，由 `DbStepResult`、`DbNormalizationResult` 以及 NbE 的结果携带；"

#: manual/semantics.md:73
msgid "running out of steps or fuel is an ordinary outcome (`StepLimitReached`, `FuelExhausted`) that reports the work done."
msgstr "步数或燃料耗尽是一种普通结果（`StepLimitReached`、`FuelExhausted`），它会报告已完成的工作量。"

#: manual/semantics.md:76
msgid "Aborting functions are marked `unsafe_` (`RuleName::unsafe_new`) and are meant for values whose validity is evident, such as literals. Internal assertions, such as the fresh-name check in substitution, are unreachable by the lemmas of the corresponding design page."
msgstr "会中止执行的函数带有 `unsafe_` 标记（`RuleName::unsafe_new`），用于有效性显而易见的值，例如字面量。内部断言（例如代换中的新鲜名字检查）根据相应设计页面中的引理是不可达的。"

#: manual/semantics.md:81
msgid "Known boundaries"
msgstr "已知边界"

#: manual/semantics.md:83
msgid "`Term[T]` treats `T` as closed: constants are never searched for variables."
msgstr "`Term[T]` 将 `T` 视为闭合的：从不在常量中查找变量。"

#: manual/semantics.md:84
msgid "Generic substitution is applied once; inserted replacements are not visited again."
msgstr "泛型代换只应用一次；插入的替换项不会被再次访问。"

#: manual/semantics.md:86
msgid "Untyped normalization is not total: `StepLimitReached` and `FuelExhausted` are expected for divergent terms."
msgstr "无类型范式化不是全函数：对于发散的项，出现 `StepLimitReached` 和 `FuelExhausted` 是预期之内的。"

#: manual/semantics.md:88
msgid "The simply typed calculus has base types, `Unit` and arrows only, and no eta law for `Unit`."
msgstr "简单类型演算只有基本类型、`Unit` 和箭头类型，并且对 `Unit` 没有 η 律。"

#: manual/semantics.md:91
msgid "The [correctness checklist](../../CORRECTNESS_CHECKLIST.md) lists the audited invariants, their evidence and the known issues."
msgstr "[正确性检查清单](../../CORRECTNESS_CHECKLIST.md)列出了经过审查的不变式、其依据以及已知问题。"

#: manual/tutorial/adapter.md:1
msgid "adapter tutorial"
msgstr "适配器教程"

#: manual/tutorial/adapter.md:3
msgid "This tutorial connects your own expression type to `type_theory`. You implement `@syntax.BindingSyntax` for a small AST and then use generic free variables, capture-avoiding substitution and rewriting on it, without converting to `Term[T]`. Finally you test the adapter laws."
msgstr "本教程将你自己的表达式类型接入 `type_theory`。你将为一个小型 AST 实现 `@syntax.BindingSyntax`，然后直接在其上使用泛型的自由变量计算、避免捕获的代换和改写，而无需转换为 `Term[T]`。最后你将测试适配器定律。"

