#: manual/tutorial/adapter.md:204
msgid "**Variables inside opaque nodes.** A node that projects as `Opaque` is never searched. If it contains variables, substitution misses them."
msgstr "**不透明节点中的变量。** 投影为 `Opaque` 的节点从不被搜索。如果其中含有变量，代换会遗漏它们。"

#: manual/tutorial/adapter.md:206
msgid "**Calling trait methods with dot syntax.** Write `@syntax.BindingSyntax::project(e)`; the method forms are not promoted."
msgstr "**用点语法调用 trait 方法。** 请写成 `@syntax.BindingSyntax::project(e)`；这些方法形式没有被提升。"

#: manual/tutorial/adapter.md:208
msgid "**Losing the node kind in `apply`.** If two node kinds project to `Apply` and the head does not say which, rebuilding changes the AST."
msgstr "**在 `apply` 中丢失节点种类。** 如果两种节点都投影为 `Apply`，而头部又不能区分它们，重建就会改变 AST。"

#: manual/tutorial/adapter.md:210
msgid "**Expecting repeated substitution.** `apply_once` substitutes once; iterate yourself if replacements mention the domain."
msgstr "**期望重复代换。** `apply_once` 只代换一次；如果替换项中提到了定义域中的名字，请自行迭代。"

